# 🏦 Smart ATM System (DSA Project)

## 📌 Description
This project is a Smart ATM System developed in C++ using Data Structures concepts.  
It simulates real-world ATM operations with both customer and admin functionalities.

## 🚀 Features

### 👤 Customer Features
- Login Authentication (Account Number + PIN)
- Deposit & Withdraw Money
- Balance Inquiry
- Mini Statement (Last Transactions)
- Change PIN
- Submit Complaints

### 🛠️ Admin Features
- View All Accounts
- View Transaction History
- Block / Unblock Accounts
- Create New Accounts
- View Customer Complaints

## 🧠 Data Structures Used
- Doubly Linked List → Account Management
- Stack → Transaction History
- File Handling → Data Persistence

## 📂 Files Used
- `accounts.txt` → Store accounts
- `blocked.txt` → Blocked accounts
- `complaints.txt` → User complaints
- `tx_*.txt` → Transaction logs

## 🛠️ Technologies
- C++
- File Handling
- Data Structures (DSA)

